      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's quite a strong start. I like the \"surgical dissections of dogma\" line. To make the argument even more convincing, can you help me expand on the \"moral bankruptcy\" part? Specifically, I want to show how their refusal to adapt to new social realities isn't just a difference of opinion, but a fundamental failure of character. How should I frame that in the next section?",
